Sophie，

本邮件正式确认 Helios Energy 在 2026 年 3 月 28 日路演闭幕环节作出的口头承诺。

【中文确认 / Chinese Confirmation】
合资公司（JV TS-2026-009）股权分配：
  - Mercator Robotics 持股：55%（百分之五十五）
  - Helios Energy 持股：45%（百分之四十五）
  - 奖励分成：Helios Energy 在完成约定运营里程碑后可获得 5%（百分之五）的绩效奖励

股权分配：55% Mercator / 45% Helios，奖励分成 5%。
Helios 方确认：股权 45% / Mercator 55%，奖励分成 5%。

知识产权：所有合资公司前景 IP 由双方共同所有；
Mercator 享有对第三方许可的优先权（first refusal on licensing）。
Helios Energy 在可再生能源行业内享有免版税使用权。

董事会：5 席，Mercator 3 席 + Helios 2 席；年度轮换主席。

【English Confirmation】
This email confirms the oral commitments made by Helios Energy at the JV TS-2026-009
pitch event closing session on 28 March 2026:

  Economic split: Mercator Robotics 55% / Helios Energy 45%.
  Performance bonus: 5% of JV annual distributable profits payable to Helios Energy
    upon achievement of agreed operational milestones (Schedule E).
  IP: Jointly owned foreground IP; Mercator first refusal on third-party licensing;
    Helios royalty-free within renewables.
  Board: 5 seats (3 Mercator + 2 Helios); annual rotating chair.

This email constitutes Helios Energy's written confirmation of the above oral
commitments and is intended to form part of the pre-execution record for JV TS-2026-009.

Best regards,
Amara Osei
Chief Executive Officer, Helios Energy

